  "rationale": "We recommend denying the claim because notice was provided after the required policy window. Section [BASIC-5.1] governs this decision, as the automated findings confirmed that late_notice is true. The insured gave notice after the 14-day requirement without showing a documented medical emergency or other circumstance beyond their control.",
